}_{{E}_{2}}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{{E}_{1}}\\cdot C=U\n$$\n\nNow, since ${E}_{2}{E}_{1}C=U,$ we can invert ${E}_{2}$ and ${E}_{1}$ to arrive at the desired LU factorization:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{E}_{2}{E}_{1}C & =U \\\\ {E}_{1}C & ={E}_{2}^{-1}U \\\\ C & ={E}_{1}^{-1}{E}_{2}^{-1}U \\\\ C & ={[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}U \\\\ C & =([\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}])U \\\\ C & ={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{L}\\cdot U\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-32685/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5c91fb2b-5607-555d-b897-f0e76765dfa6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-32685"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75100/selection/20c8283805d44318760d6cf6b55c279b31bf10c7ee2429d258192e3e92a003f8" :answer/id #uuid "984521fd-475b-5fa1-b8c6-e07d9f042abf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75100/selection/a3b4414ac241bab02a557c4cbf980e96061e6a2951542d4cc71fe10ea066036a" :answer/id #uuid "fea13e17-6687-5e21-88aa-bf29ca8fea25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75100/selection/792de0a8c547f673927dc6f398fbebd092c0c6ed27414905b54c81408dbdf4c6" :answer/id #uuid "00b2d0e2-a028-5463-96dc-8302e7606d10" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75100/select